Output .work/out/05-blocked.mp4
Source .work/head.tape
Hide
Source .work/stage.tape
Type "@all we're adding per-key rate limiting to the gateway. maya take the middleware, omar the 429 state in the client, priya a --rate-limit flag, luca the changelog."
Enter
Sleep 12s
Show
Sleep 2s

# The roster has already re-ranked omar to the top and gone yellow. ^X is the
# key that goes to whoever is blocked without hunting for the row.
Ctrl+X
Sleep 4s

# A permission is armed with its rune and settled with Enter.
Type "a"
Sleep 1500ms
Enter
Sleep 7s
